**Validation status:**
- `15-0add-9deg-250s-N2-1600s` has 10 runs but shows enormous variability (pore fraction SD across runs: ~0.12, modulus CV across runs: ~25%). This is not yet reproducibly confirmed as a Pareto-front candidate — the mean pore fraction across all runs is ~0.66 and mean modulus ~243 bar, which is still attractive but the spread is large.
- The condition has been run many times but the high-pore-fraction values (0.77, 0.85) appear in only 2 of 10 runs, suggesting they may be outliers rather than reproducible.

